@----------------------------------------
@node DECLARATIONS1
@prev STATEMENTS
@next CONTROLSTRUCTS
@toc INDEX
@{h1}Declarations

Declarations: variable declarations, function definitions, and function
prototypes

<decl>       ::= <vardecl>
               | <funcdecl>
               | <funcproto>

@{h2}Function prototype
Note the trailing semicolon instead of a body

<funcproto>  ::= <rettype> <ident> "(" <arglist> ")" ";"

@{h2}Assignment Expressions
Either a simple identifier or a more complex lvalue/expression on
the left-hand side.

<assignment> ::= <lvalue> "=" <expr> ";"

<lvalue>     ::= <ident>
               | <ident> "[" <expr> "]"
               | "*" <lvalue>
               | "&" <lvalue>
